;
; Biesse Skill 1224 - parameters written to every drive at each LinuxCNC start (RAM only).
; Everything else stays as stored in the drives (Biesse tuning).
;
; Pn81E: map CN1 inputs into the MECHATROLINK monitor bits IO12..IO14,
; which nyx reports as servo-MM.in-00..02:
;   IO12 = SI1 CN1-7 P-OT, IO13 = SI2 CN1-8 N-OT, IO14 = SI3 CN1-9 /DEC (home)
Pn81E	0x0432	;	Input Signal Monitor Selection
